== Zodiacs ==
Zodiacs are collectible entities in the [[Unity#Astrology|Astrology]] system that provide bonuses when assigned to [[Planets]]. Each Zodiac belongs to one of four Elements &mdash; {{ZodiacBadge|Fire}}, {{ZodiacBadge|Wind}}, {{ZodiacBadge|Water}} or {{ZodiacBadge|Earth}} &mdash; and corresponds to one of the four seasons.

The strength of each Zodiac's bonuses scales with its [[Zodiacs#Zodiac Quality|<span style="color: #eaac2d;">Quality</span>]], [[Zodiacs#Zodiac Level|<span style="color: #3f6af4;">Level</span>]], and [[Zodiacs#Zodiac Rarity|<span style="color: inherit;">Rarity</span>]]. If you want to reroll, it will cost you 200 souls. (+50 per reroll)

=== Zodiac Signs ===

There are 12 Zodiac signs in total. Each can have up to four possible bonuses unique to its sign and element group. Some bonuses are shared across signs of the same element.

